  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Support for the Integration of Third Country Nationals in Croatia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to support the Ministry of the Interior of the Republic of Croatia in enhancing its capacity to oversee, coordinate and monitor the implementation of coherent national policies and mechanisms for the integration of third country nationals in Croatia. In the long run, the project also aims to pursue effective knowledge management and consistency of goals and actions across the integration programmes implemented by stakeholders at multiple levels (national, regional and local). The action will result in the design of a one-stop-shop model and establishment of a policy coordination mechanism. It will contribute to streamlining and strengthening integration actions both at national and sub-national levels, ultimately supporting migrants&#x2019; inclusion within the labour markets and society.</narrative>
  </description>
